{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3jJfHjyy7Hj1Xyws5k","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, weathered oak bound in iron. As you speak the word, the grain of the wood shivers. A single crack of light splits vertically down the center.*\n\n*But nothing opens.*\n\n*Letters slowly burn themselves into the wood, glowing like embers:*\n\n```\nWHICH DOOR DID YOU NAME?\n```\n\n*The iron bindings groan. The light fades. The door waits — patient, eternal, unnamed.*\n\n*You must name the door to pass through it.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":119,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}